# ============================================================
# Production build-time environment variables (frontend only)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# This file IS committed to the repo on purpose: every VITE_*
# variable here is PUBLIC and gets inlined into the JS bundle
# at build time by Vite. No secrets in this file.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL:
#   Base URL of the Express backend API (the Render service).
#   The apiClient appends endpoints like /auth/signin after this.
#
#   🔧 IMPORTANT: Replace the placeholder below with your real
#   Render service URL before/after deploying, e.g.
#     VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://rapiqr-api.onrender.com/api"
#   You can also override it in the Cloudflare Pages dashboard
#   (Settings → Environment Variables → Production), which takes
#   precedence over this file at build time.
# ============================================================
VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://rapiqr.onrender.com"
